‖ζ(s) − S_N(s) − N^{1−s}/(s−1)‖ ≤ C N^{−σ} for all s = σ + it ≠ 1 with σ₀ ≤ σ ≤ 2, 0 ≤ t ≤ N,
N ≥ 1. -/
theorem zeta_approx_sharp {σ₀ : ℝ} (hσ₀ : 0 < σ₀) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, ∀ σ t : ℝ, σ₀ ≤ σ → σ ≤ 2 → 0 ≤ t → ∀ N : ℕ, 1 ≤ N → t ≤ N →
      (σ : ℂ) + t * I ≠ 1 →
