/-! ## I. The uniform mean square for every σ₁ > 1/2 -/

/-- `S N (σ + it)` is the tree's `Dpoly σ N t` (coefficients `n^{−σ}`, twist `n^{−it}`). -/
lemma S_eq_Dpoly (σ : ℝ) (N : ℕ) (t : ℝ) :
    S N ((σ : ℂ) + t * I) = Zeta23.BL.M3.Dpoly σ N t := by
  sorry

