  sorry

/-- The pointwise square bound from the sharp approximate formula: if
`‖ζ(s) − S_N(s) − N^{1−s}/(s−1)‖ ≤ C` then
`‖ζ(s)‖² ≤ 4‖Dpoly σ N t‖² + 4 N^{2−2σ₁}/t² + 4C²` (for `σ ≥ σ₁`, `t ≥ 1`, `N ≥ 1`). -/
